    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have become remarkably adept at channeling magic to compel others. If you cast an Enchantment spell using a level 1+ spell slot, you can change its casting time to a Bonus Action for this casting, provided its casting time is normally an action. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
